I like the overall composition and collection of elements. In my top 3. I would probably have put the focus a bit more to the back (on the nuts and ham) because the zig-zag lines are leading my eye towards that point. In my view the focus is too far to the front, on the white plates and empty space.</td>', 'I like the overall composition and collection of elements. In my top 3. I would probably have put the focus a bit more to the back (on the nuts and ham) because the zig-zag lines are leading my eye towards that point. In my view the focus is too far to the front, on the white plates and empty space.', '2024-12-30 06:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7774194, 1291880, 4008, '<td valign="top">
